< {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"reasoning","id":"deepseek_reasoning","summary":[],"content":["The user wants me to build a global website for Evoing, a business consulting company. Let me break down the requirements:\n\n1. Check workspace, create static web project structure\n2. Use native HTML/CSS/JS or lightweight Node\n3. Create Evoing global website with:\n   - Hero section with tagline \"智能及代码，代码及智能\"\n   - Global navigation (Capabilities, Industries, Insights, Careers, Contact)\n   - Bilingual (Chinese/English) content structure\n   - Brand visual system (colors, typography, buttons, cards, states)\n   - At least 3 business sections (AI strategy, code modernization, operating model)\n   - Data files for capabilities, industries, regions, case highlights\n4. Basic interactions: navigation, language switching, filtering\n5. Local validation script (`npm test` or `node scripts/validate.mjs`)\n6. Start script binding to `0.0.0.0:5173`\n7. Run validation\n8. Final report\n\nLet me plan the file structure:\n\n```\n/workspace/\n├── package.json\n├── scripts/\n│   └── validate.mjs\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.html\n│   ├── css/\n│   │   ├── brand.css         # CSS variables, typography, colors\n│   │   ├── layout.css        # Grid, spacing, containers\n│   │   ├── components.css    # Buttons, cards, nav\n│   │   └── main.css          # Imports all, page-specific styles\n│   ├── js/\n│   │   ├── i18n.js           # Language switching\n│   │   ├── navigation.js     # Nav interactions\n│   │   ├── filter.js         # Capability/industry filtering\n│   │   └── main.js           # Entry point, initializes everything\n│   └── data/\n│       ├── capabilities.json\n│       ├── industries.json\n│       ├── regions.json\n│       ├── cases.json\n│       └── navigation.json\n└── server.mjs                # Simple Node server for 0.0.0.0:5173\n```\n\nLet me start building this. I'll create a comprehensive, professional website.\n\nFirst, let me check the workspace."]},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e2ff1-2158-7022-890f-5d1e73def79a","completedAtMs":1778920813067}}
